; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M10: EMA trailing (TrailMode 7), setup 1 of 2: sell, session AllDay server time, trend filter H4 EMA 100, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: stop beyond the EMA(34) of M10 closes, once the profit reaches 0.5R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 7, TrailParam 34).
; Same setup as Loma_T15_BTC_M10_EMA_1of2_Sell_AllDay_H4 in Loma_BTCUSD_v1_35.zip (only the magic number and the trade comment differ): run one or the other, not both. Its Loma_T15 header gives the one-minute backtest's figures; the replay's are here.
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (10 USD spread; score 1.43): 115 trades, PF 1.59. Replay of the same months: 115 trades, PF 1.58.
; REPLAY ON BINANCE BTCUSDT ONE-SECOND PRICES (four price points per second; the EA's rules; 10 USD spread, no commission). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 44 trades, PF 2.39, net +16.6R (stressed PF 2.26); the 2 setups of M10 + EMA together 102 trades, PF 1.90, net +22.9R (stressed 2.03).
; EMA trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M10 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 100+ trades in those months; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 2024, 62 trades, PF 1.47; 2023 (from 15 Jan), 75 trades, PF 1.06. The 2 setups together: 2024, 156 trades, PF 1.02; 2023 (from 15 Jan), 201 trades, PF 0.96. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT, broker server time. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
